Subject: arrowlake-h enabling

Add Arrow Lake-H (family 6, model 0xC5 / 197) to the supported platform
table and ship intel_lpmd_config_F6_M197.xml. Rebased from intel/intel-lpmd#121,
with the WLT state values from spandruvada's config in that thread, and EPP/EPB
values tweaked to allow intel-lpmd to run alongside tlp properly.
